To run local cluster we do not need to specify the master cluster in teh code we can use spark-submit code

spark-submit as this:

URL="spark://Amits-MacBook-Air.local:7077"

spark-submit \
    --master="${URL}" \
    10_spark_local.py \
        --input_green="data/pq/green/2021/*/" \
        --input_yellow="data/pq/yellow/2021/*/" \
        --output=data/report-2021